# The Vidrip Mimic SDK (@vidrip/*) is published to GitHub Packages. No token here: authenticate once per machine with
#   npm login --scope=@vidrip --auth-type=legacy --registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
# (a classic token with read:packages), which stores it in your user ~/.npmrc.
@vidrip:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
